---
import AppLayout from '../../../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
import Topbar from '../../../components/Topbar.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
import AppRail from '../../../components/AppRail.astro';
import Chapter from '../../../components/Chapter.astro';
import { getApp } from '../../../data/apps';
const app = getApp('plantekn');
---
<AppLayout app={app} title={`Terms · ${app.name}`}>
  <Topbar variant="app" />
  <div class="app-page">
    <AppRail app={app} current="vilkar" />
    <div class="app-flow">
      <Chapter num="01" label="License" title={`Distributed via <em>App Store</em>.`}>
        <p class="lede">{app.name} is developed and published by Haug og Datter, and distributed through the Apple App Store. You receive a personal, non-transferable license to use the app under <a class="tx-link" href="https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apple's Standard End User License Agreement</a>.</p>
        <p class="muted">Last updated · 14 May 2026.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="02" label="Use" title={`All use happens <em>locally</em>.`}>
        <p>{app.name} lets you create 2D floor plans with furniture, doors, windows and stairs, and visualise them in 3D. All use happens locally on your device. You don't need an account.</p>
        <p>You may use the app for personal and commercial purposes — planning your own renovation, valuation work, real-estate prospects or architectural sketching. There is no limit on the number of floor plans with {app.name} PRO.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="03" label="Free and PRO" title={`A one-time purchase, <em>not a subscription</em>.`}>
        <p>The app is free to download. The free version includes one project at a time, one floor, a selection of 18 furniture types, 2D drawing tools, 3D visualisation and PNG export.</p>
        <p>{app.name} PRO is a one-time purchase. After purchase you get:</p>
        <p>· Unlimited number of projects</p>
        <p>· Multiple floors and basement</p>
        <p>· The full furniture library</p>
        <p>· AI-based furniture suggestions</p>
        <p>· PDF export with room summary</p>
        <p>· Photo Trace (reference-image tracing layer)</p>
        <p>· Apple Pencil support</p>
        <p>· Export without watermark</p>
        <p class="muted">Price and local currency are shown in the App Store purchase dialog.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="04" label="Refunds" title={`Refunds are handled by <em>Apple</em>.`}>
        <p>Refunds for {app.name} PRO are handled by Apple. Request a refund via the App Store at <a class="tx-link" href="https://reportaproblem.apple.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">reportaproblem.apple.com</a>.</p>
        <p class="muted">{app.name} cannot itself refund purchases made through the App Store.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="05" label="Ownership" title={`The drawings <em>belong to you</em>.`}>
        <p>Your floor plans are yours. They are stored as `.plantekn` files (open JSON format) on your device and in your iCloud Drive if enabled. You can export, share or delete them at any time. We do not collect personal data — see the <a class="tx-link" href="/en/plantekn/personvern/">privacy policy</a> for details.</p>
        <p class="muted">The app itself — code, design, icons and name — is owned by Haug og Datter. Purchasing {app.name} PRO grants you a personal, non-exclusive licence in accordance with Apple's Standard EULA. You may not copy, distribute, modify or reverse-engineer the app.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="06" label="Liability" title={`A sketch, <em>not a building permit</em>.`}>
        <p>{app.name} is provided "as is". We give no warranty that the app is bug-free or that it meets your specific needs. Floor plans created in the app are sketches — they do not replace professional architectural drawings, building permits or official property valuations.</p>
        <p>Area calculations (BRA, P-rom, S-rom under NS 3940) are based on what you draw. Accuracy depends on you drawing correctly. To the extent permitted by Norwegian law, {app.name} cannot be held liable for financial losses or other consequences arising from use of the app.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="07" label="Changes" title={`Significant changes are <em>announced</em>.`}>
        <p>We may update, change or remove features in the app. Significant changes are communicated through App Store release notes or the "What's New" sheet in the app.</p>
        <p>These terms may change. Updates are posted on this page with a new "Last updated" date. Continued use of the app after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
        <p class="muted">These terms are governed by Norwegian law. Disputes shall first be attempted resolved amicably. If that fails, the proper venue is the Norwegian Consumer Authority (Forbrukertilsynet) and then Norwegian courts.</p>
      </Chapter>

      <Chapter num="08" label="Contact" title={`Questions? <em>Write to us.</em>`}>
        <p><strong>Provider:</strong> Jonas Haug (Haug & Datter), Drammen, Norway.</p>
        <p>Send email to <a class="tx-link" href="mailto:jonas@haugogdatter.no">jonas@haugogdatter.no</a>. The <a class="tx-link" href="/en/plantekn/personvern/">privacy policy</a> for the app is here.</p>
      </Chapter>
    </div>
  </div>
  <Footer label={`${app.name} · Terms`} />
</AppLayout>
